WEBVTT

00:03.120 --> 00:05.350
<i>Winter was starting. </i>

00:07.380 --> 00:09.330
<i>From last spring to fall... </i>

00:09.780 --> 00:12.410
<i>I lost half a year's worth of memories. </i>

00:14.170 --> 00:16.760
<i>I heard that I got into a car accident.</i>

00:16.760 --> 00:18.760
<i>But I can't even remember that.</i>

00:24.200 --> 00:25.720
<i>This past month...</i>

00:26.130 --> 00:28.610
<i>the same old days continued. </i>

00:55.150 --> 01:01.870
Shining stars away bless

00:55.700 --> 01:01.870
Shining stars away bless

01:02.200 --> 01:07.080
chiisakutonaeru mahou no kotobawa

01:02.200 --> 01:07.080
Silently chanting the magical words

01:07.960 --> 01:09.710
『onegai。。。』

01:07.960 --> 01:09.710
"please"

01:10.000 --> 01:15.340
hoshizora samayou kaze ni notta maigo notsubu

01:10.000 --> 01:15.340
The lost grain riding the wind on the sky

01:15.340 --> 01:16.380
『kizuite。。。』

01:15.340 --> 01:16.380
Please notice

01:16.380 --> 01:24.270
tsutawara nakute porori ochita kono omoi

01:16.380 --> 01:24.270
Untold words, teardrops of feelings that fell down

01:24.770 --> 01:31.360
kagayaki dasuyo GARASU bin nonaka

01:24.770 --> 01:31.360
Show your shine inside the glass bottle

01:31.730 --> 01:38.740
manten no hoshi deatta KISEKI kimi ga soba ni itekureru nara

01:31.730 --> 01:38.740
If you will stay beside me perfect star of encountered miracles...

01:38.910 --> 01:46.120
Whatever the mystery, I will be able to gather my courage.

01:39.320 --> 01:46.120
donna fushigi mouke tomeru yuuki umare te yuku yo

01:46.460 --> 01:53.710
nanatsuiro ni hikaru houseki sora kara mai oriru

01:46.460 --> 01:53.710
Seven colored glittering gems flying down from the sky

01:53.710 --> 01:57.430
Scoop up the important fragments

01:54.130 --> 01:57.430
daijina KAKERA sukui agerune

01:57.430 --> 02:02.930
kowasa nuyou sotto。。。

01:57.430 --> 02:02.930
And secretly hold onto them tight

02:13.750 --> 02:15.270
Yo, Haru.

02:16.740 --> 02:18.250
What's wrong?

02:18.250 --> 02:19.920
Spacing out like that.

02:19.920 --> 02:22.710
How do you manage here? It's freezing.

02:25.750 --> 02:28.440
Something is wrong.

02:28.680 --> 02:29.920
Wrong?

02:30.790 --> 02:34.170
During this past month...

02:35.110 --> 02:36.310
I...

02:36.780 --> 02:41.310
Something keeps bothering me.

02:42.700 --> 02:44.260
Something important?

02:48.360 --> 02:51.270
I can't remember... no matter how hard I try.

02:51.470 --> 02:52.790
Actually....

02:54.480 --> 02:56.580
Keisuke, you said it before, right?

02:56.880 --> 02:58.590
I was in the Gardening Club before.

02:58.590 --> 03:00.420
Right, right, the Gardening Club.

03:01.320 --> 03:03.380
Why did I join the Gardening Club?

03:03.380 --> 03:06.030
U-Um...

03:06.820 --> 03:09.290
It seems that Kisaragi-sensei recommended it to you.

03:14.790 --> 03:16.930
That's what Sensei said.

03:17.830 --> 03:19.900
T-Tsuwabuki-kun.

03:19.900 --> 03:24.240
When your body gets better, come back to the Gardening Club whenever you can.

03:24.770 --> 03:26.140
Y-Yeah.

03:30.830 --> 03:33.930
Um... Akihime, was it?

03:33.930 --> 03:35.510
Yeah, that's right!

03:35.510 --> 03:36.620
Akihime Sumomo!

03:38.770 --> 03:41.360
<i>It was the Gardening Club.</i>

03:44.280 --> 03:48.160
First Love is Seven Colored

03:54.750 --> 03:55.960
Sumomo.

03:59.600 --> 04:00.850
Are you okay?

04:04.260 --> 04:05.760
You're not pushing yourself, right?

04:06.730 --> 04:09.170
It's okay, I'm fine.

04:09.430 --> 04:13.370
Let's go, Nako-chan. We'll be late for the afternoon class.

04:22.210 --> 04:24.120
The properties of a metal.

04:24.120 --> 04:25.810
First, malleability.

04:25.810 --> 04:29.250
The property of being able to be flattened out into thin sheets.

04:29.250 --> 04:31.000
Second, ductility.

04:31.000 --> 04:36.540
It means the ability of the matter to be stretched long and thin, and to have a special metallic luster.

04:37.170 --> 04:41.470
Also, the amount of heat and electricity that can be transferred...

04:39.920 --> 04:41.470
<i>Haru-kun...</i>

04:42.540 --> 04:45.430
<i>His body seems healthy.</i>

04:45.710 --> 04:47.230
<i>That's a relief.</i>

04:50.410 --> 04:53.210
<i>I'm happy every day...</i>

04:53.540 --> 04:57.540
<i>because the memories are scattered out in many places.</i>

04:59.330 --> 05:03.940
<i>Every day, I can see Haru-kun.</i>

05:05.460 --> 05:06.900
Hey, Haru, you're free after this, right?

05:06.900 --> 05:07.920
I am, but...

05:07.630 --> 05:08.700
Well then...

05:08.340 --> 05:09.670
I'm happy.

05:09.570 --> 05:10.210
What is it?

05:10.210 --> 05:11.240
Let's go somewhere.

05:11.650 --> 05:14.870
See you again tomorrow, Haru-kun.

05:41.470 --> 05:42.680
<i>Again... </i>

05:43.600 --> 05:46.720
<i>I get anxious whenever sunset comes around.</i>

05:47.770 --> 05:50.980
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

05:53.380 --> 05:55.590
<i>I'm anxious about something.</i>

05:56.000 --> 05:58.770
<i>Something as I see the sunset... </i>

06:16.810 --> 06:18.780
What is this?

06:39.310 --> 06:42.730
Today, for the first time, I dated Haru-kun.			

06:43.260 --> 06:46.340
That day was just like a dream.

06:46.340 --> 06:50.890
Even when we rode the boat, I thought about the kiss...

06:53.240 --> 06:57.880
Then Haru-kun looked at me, and smiled brightly.

07:08.950 --> 07:11.520
<i>I was looking at the stars.</i>

07:12.790 --> 07:14.260
<i>They looked as if they were about to fall... </i>

07:19.090 --> 07:21.230
<i>And there was someone beside me...  </i>

07:33.980 --> 07:35.200
Sumomo!

07:51.820 --> 08:03.960
kizuite hora kira kira hikaru hoshi kuzu no youni

07:51.820 --> 08:03.960
Please notice just like the light from the stardust

08:26.560 --> 08:27.870
No.

08:28.000 --> 08:30.170
I promised...

08:54.470 --> 08:56.400
G-Good morning.

08:56.850 --> 08:58.610
Ah, um...

08:58.610 --> 08:59.960
Is this the Gardening Club?

09:00.130 --> 09:01.340
Yeah.

09:04.720 --> 09:05.670
Um...

09:06.300 --> 09:09.980
Why is Tsuwabuki-kun, on a Sunday...

09:14.400 --> 09:19.490
I was thinking that maybe I'll remember something.

09:14.550 --> 09:15.890
um... {Um...}

09:21.590 --> 09:25.030
I... What was I doing in the Gardening Club?

09:25.580 --> 09:26.940
You were...

09:26.940 --> 09:30.530
pulling out weeds and watering flowers.

09:30.530 --> 09:33.730
We even did things like planting acorns.

09:34.130 --> 09:35.510
Acorns?

09:40.170 --> 09:41.760
Like this.

09:41.760 --> 09:43.350
Also...

09:43.710 --> 09:47.190
There was a time when you made the sprinkler.

09:47.190 --> 09:49.500
Tsuwabuki-kun did a really good-

09:53.980 --> 09:55.400
I'm okay.

09:55.400 --> 09:57.910
It's nothing, so I'm fine.

09:57.910 --> 09:59.040
Hang on a second.

09:59.040 --> 10:00.840
Let's see, a handkerchief...

10:06.100 --> 10:08.450
Why do I have...?

10:16.990 --> 10:18.230
Um...

10:19.010 --> 10:21.130
Hold out your finger.

10:38.070 --> 10:39.290
Um...

10:45.060 --> 10:47.000
T-Tsuwabuki-kun.

10:47.430 --> 10:49.870
Would you like to see the greenhouse?

10:49.870 --> 10:51.980
You might remember something.

10:52.230 --> 10:54.980
The flowers are very pretty.

10:55.380 --> 10:59.090
At night, it's like a planetarium.

10:59.090 --> 11:00.950
There are lots of stars...

11:00.950 --> 11:02.120
Planetarium?

11:08.070 --> 11:11.460
Sorry, there's somewhere I need to go to right now.

11:11.460 --> 11:12.660
See you later.

11:28.550 --> 11:31.220
You're as clumsy as usual.

11:33.210 --> 11:35.000
Aspalas-san.

11:38.220 --> 11:39.560
Thank you.

11:47.760 --> 11:51.640
It's a medicine I made with the star drops I've collected.

11:52.200 --> 11:54.570
Medicine? How...

11:54.570 --> 11:57.830
The star drops that are important to Aspalas-san...

11:57.830 --> 11:58.970
It's all right.

11:58.970 --> 12:04.180
Anyways, if you let Tsuwabuki-kun drink this, he will regain his memory of loving you.

12:04.180 --> 12:05.460
I just know it.

12:08.170 --> 12:11.080
That's the most important thing right now, isn't it?

12:11.080 --> 12:12.060
Thank you.

12:13.540 --> 12:15.030
I knew it all along...

12:15.030 --> 12:17.140
...that Nona-chan was a nice person.

12:17.140 --> 12:18.690
I knew it a long time ago.

12:22.480 --> 12:25.430
But you know, I'll be okay without the medicine.

12:26.300 --> 12:27.570
Why?!

12:27.570 --> 12:29.430
We promised.

12:30.290 --> 12:34.480
Haru-kun will definitely keep the promise.

12:35.420 --> 12:39.040
Until then, I'll keep waiting.

12:39.040 --> 12:40.300
But, that is...

12:40.300 --> 12:42.630
I don't know what the promise was,

12:42.630 --> 12:45.030
but he forgot everything, you know!

12:45.310 --> 12:48.040
For Nona-chan's feelings, I'm happy.

12:49.180 --> 12:51.550
I'll keep it as a precious charm.

12:53.680 --> 12:57.430
Even from now on, you'll be my friend, right?

13:00.140 --> 13:00.940
You-...

13:01.110 --> 13:02.530
You're stupid...

13:02.530 --> 13:03.950
You're too nice.

13:08.460 --> 13:11.030
<i>I didn't want to lose to that child.</i>

13:11.030 --> 13:13.150
<i>Being the daughter of a genius...</i>

13:13.150 --> 13:16.090
<i>Because of that, she was overflowing with talent.</i>

13:16.090 --> 13:17.590
<i>It was unforgivable.</i>

13:18.170 --> 13:20.590
<i>But, I understand now... </i>

13:21.170 --> 13:23.340
<i>...the reason why I lost to that child.</i>

13:24.000 --> 13:27.910
<i>What I was lacking wasn't talent.</i>

13:29.650 --> 13:31.410
<i>It was that kindness. </i>

13:34.730 --> 13:38.420
We'll always be friends, Nona-chan!

14:00.440 --> 14:01.920
The Planetarium.

14:05.630 --> 14:08.940
<i>I was probably here before.</i>

14:18.020 --> 14:19.800
<i>I was with someone.</i>

14:32.680 --> 14:34.180
<i>We were walking together.</i>

14:51.760 --> 14:52.810
<i>Who...</i>

15:26.020 --> 15:28.400
<i>That person was always with me. </i>

15:30.470 --> 15:31.740
Haru-kun.

16:11.900 --> 16:14.380
<i>Why do I long for something?</i>

16:16.850 --> 16:18.740
<i>That girl definitely...</i>

16:19.020 --> 16:21.450
<i>rode on this merry-go-round.</i>

16:42.790 --> 16:44.120
<i>Kind...</i>

16:45.090 --> 16:46.380
<i>Cute... </i>

16:49.240 --> 16:51.620
<i>I loved that girl.</i>

16:51.610 --> 16:52.930
<i>I definitely did.</i>

16:57.810 --> 16:59.690
Keisuke, tell me.

16:59.690 --> 17:02.110
If you know who that girl is, right now...

17:03.120 --> 17:07.460
Sumomo

17:07.570 --> 17:09.480
In that moment, I realized...

17:09.480 --> 17:11.450
