17:12.250 --> 17:13.470
Yeah, that's right!

17:13.870 --> 17:14.960
Akihime Sumomo!

17:28.110 --> 17:29.450
Akihime.

17:31.840 --> 17:33.280
Akihime Sumomo.

17:50.630 --> 17:52.670
Would you like to see the greenhouse?

18:29.750 --> 18:31.180
This song...

19:10.150 --> 19:12.610
Haru-kun's pocket...

19:13.150 --> 19:16.050
It was a magical pocket.

19:16.480 --> 19:20.540
The memory of us secretly hidden...

19:21.020 --> 19:24.150
It's also hiding in my heart.

19:24.640 --> 19:26.060
Star-sama...

19:26.710 --> 19:27.820
The planetarium...

19:28.810 --> 19:30.150
And the merry-go-round.

19:31.260 --> 19:34.560
They are all held there.

19:35.470 --> 19:37.570
Our treasures...

19:45.370 --> 19:46.690
Haru-kun.

19:47.550 --> 19:58.940
kizuite hora kirakira hikaru hoshikuzu no you ni

19:47.550 --> 19:58.940
Please notice just like the light from the stardust

19:57.500 --> 19:58.790
Sumomo!

20:03.400 --> 20:11.370
anata wo omoinagara miageruhoshizora

20:03.400 --> 20:11.370
Looking at the starry sky while thinking of you,

20:06.000 --> 20:10.860
I've definitely called Akihime by Sumomo.

20:11.940 --> 20:21.710
imagoro wa nani shiteru no kana setsunai katamoi

20:11.940 --> 20:21.710
wondering what are you doing now unrequited love

20:13.810 --> 20:15.850
Always by my side...

20:16.540 --> 20:17.750
Sumomo.

20:22.230 --> 20:34.860
donna negaigoto mo kanaeru fushiginanagareboshi mitsuketara

20:22.230 --> 20:34.860
If only I find a shooting star that will grant any wish

20:34.860 --> 20:49.400
sotto kurikaesu 「ashita wa kinoyori kagayaku youni」

20:34.860 --> 20:49.400
I quietly repeat that tomorrow will be brighter than yesterday

20:49.560 --> 20:55.530
todoketai nandatte kanaeru yuuki de

20:49.560 --> 20:55.530
I want the courage to reach you, to do anything.

20:51.440 --> 20:53.950
The acorn that was a stray...

20:53.950 --> 20:56.520
