20:55.530 --> 21:02.250
tsutaetai sono mama no anata ga suki datte

20:55.530 --> 21:02.250
I want to tell you that I like you as you are

20:57.140 --> 21:00.030
Together... Together we planted it...

21:01.290 --> 21:02.730
Haru-kun.

21:02.270 --> 21:08.340
makesou ni nattemo akiramenai zettai

21:02.270 --> 21:08.340
I will not give up even if I were to lose,

21:04.110 --> 21:05.240
Sumomo...

21:08.340 --> 21:14.440
chisai keredo taisetsuna yume dakara

21:08.340 --> 21:14.440
even though it's a small but important dream

21:10.020 --> 21:11.080
I love you.

21:12.670 --> 21:14.800
What has happened, I don't remember.

21:14.440 --> 21:20.490
Can it be true hitoridemo furikaeranai

21:14.440 --> 21:20.490
Can it be true? Will I not look back even if I'm alone?

21:15.090 --> 21:16.560
Not even one bit.

21:17.070 --> 21:19.220
But my heart remembers.

21:20.490 --> 21:27.260
So you are sure ima nara fumidaseru hazu dayone

21:20.490 --> 21:27.260
So, you are sure... now you can surely move forward

21:20.600 --> 21:22.040
I love Sumomo.

21:27.280 --> 21:41.750
kizuite hora kirakira hikaruhoshi kuzu no youni nagareru in my dream

21:27.280 --> 21:41.750
Please notice just like the light from the stardust flowing in my dream

21:29.560 --> 21:30.870
Haru-kun.

21:35.110 --> 21:38.690
I don't know when I started loving you.

21:38.690 --> 21:41.540
So I, about Sumomo...

21:42.320 --> 21:45.160
I'll love you once again...

21:45.800 --> 21:47.020
from the very beginning.

21:52.660 --> 22:00.150
hitori de utsumukanai yume miru watashi ni

21:52.660 --> 22:00.150
Alone with my head facing ahead, I wonder if I will ever get used to watching a dream,

22:00.150 --> 22:10.750
nareru kana douka ashita he to fumidasemasu youni

22:00.150 --> 22:10.750
and hoping that tomorrow I can move forward

22:11.160 --> 22:24.270
donna negai koto mo kanauyo shinjite daijyoubu me wo tojite

22:11.160 --> 22:24.270
I believe that any wish can be granted; it's all right, so open your eyes

22:24.270 --> 22:38.680
sotto te wo kazasu 「anata ga kinouyori kagayaku youni」

22:24.270 --> 22:38.680
I gently hold my hands out, for tomorrow you will be brighter than yesterday

22:38.680 --> 22:44.590
todoketai nandatte kanaeru 『yuuki』 de

22:38.680 --> 22:44.590
I want the courage to reach you, to do anything,

22:44.590 --> 22:51.360
tsutaetaii tsu no hi mo anata ga suki datte

22:44.590 --> 22:51.360
I want to tell you everyday that I like you as you are

22:51.420 --> 22:57.400
nakisou ni nattemo akiramenai zettai

22:51.420 --> 22:57.400
I will not give up even if I feel like crying,

22:57.510 --> 23:03.530
ichiban tsuyoi taisetsuna omoi dakara

22:57.510 --> 23:03.530
because it's the strongest of all my feelings

23:03.530 --> 23:09.540
Can it be true? kujikesou demo furikaeranai

23:03.530 --> 23:09.540
Can it be true? Will I not look back even if it seems to break?

23:09.550 --> 23:16.350
So you are sure kimi nara mitsukerareru hazu dayone

23:09.550 --> 23:16.350
So, you are sure if it's you... surely you can find it

23:16.350 --> 23:29.300
shinjite hora kira kira hikaru hoshi kuzu mo kitto tsukameru yo my dream

23:16.350 --> 23:29.300
Please believe that you can even grab the stardust of my dream

23:29.300 --> 23:32.240
itsuka kanauyo zettai

23:29.300 --> 23:32.240
The wish will definitely come true, someday

23:32.250 --> 23:35.490
kanarazu kimi nara dekiru

23:32.250 --> 23:35.490
You can definitely do it

23:35.490 --> 23:45.910
saa yukousono yume no mukoo he

23:35.490 --> 23:45.910
Now let's go... to the dream beyond!

23:50.610 --> 23:51.540
For example,

23:51.540 --> 23:54.540
when looking at the stars outside the window...

23:54.800 --> 23:55.970
For example,

23:55.970 --> 23:58.870
when writing in the secret journal about the day...

24:00.260 --> 24:04.880
Mysterious things suddenly fall down from the sky.

24:05.560 --> 24:10.530
The key to everything are the star drops that fall down from the night sky, and...

24:10.530 --> 24:12.750
a special girl.

24:13.350 --> 24:18.900
Snow Drop Flower Language - The Path of First Love

24:13.660 --> 24:18.470
It is a magical story of, "A seven colored first love that encompasses you."
